{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","猩红斩刑"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","ブラッディエクセキューション"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","奈拉高举斧头劈砍一名敌方英雄，对生命值较低的目标造成更高的伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","ナーラは敵英雄1体の頭上に斧を振り下ろす。対象のHPが一定未満の場合はダメージUP"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","该技能初始拥有750点能量。短暂蓄力后，对目标英雄造成320% + 35% ATK伤害。若目标生命值低于40%，则改为造成560% + 60% ATK的真实伤害。自动战斗时，不会对生命值高于40%的非首领敌方英雄使用。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","初期SPが750になる。力を溜めてから、対象の英雄に320% + 35% ATKのダメージを与える。対象のHPが40%より低い場合、代わりに560% + 60% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。オート戦闘の場合、HPが40%より高いボス系以外の英雄に対しては発動されない"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至330% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至570% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが330% + 35% ATKにUPし、HPが一定未満の対象に与えるダメージが570% + 60% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":47,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat